# Project philosophy

- **Locked essence:** [docs/ESSENCE.md](docs/ESSENCE.md) — Atlas is **not** a site constructor; pick a design system → preview → Agent + Constructor prompts → **build elsewhere** (Cursor / Tilda-class agent).
- **Product:** design-system library + dual prompt bridge ([docs/PRODUCT.md](docs/PRODUCT.md)). Not an encyclopedia, design course, or page builder.
- **One loop:** see design system on a landing → get Agent + Constructor prompts (+ files) → build the unique project elsewhere.
- **Core flow:** template + style → preview → dual prompt / Design Pack → Cursor or constructor agent ([ADR-0009](docs/decisions/ADR-0009-template-style-preview-prompt.md), [ADR-0011](docs/decisions/ADR-0011-dual-prompt-surfaces.md)).
- **Reference ≠ copy:** DesignPrompts is a product reference only — no copying code, texts, style names, or graphics without rights; build an original library.
- **Language:** UI/demo **Russian**; prompts **RU+EN**; technical docs **English** ([ADR-0010](docs/decisions/ADR-0010-russian-only-locale.md)).
- **Source of truth:** Git — `docs/`, `content/`, `design/`; no DB/CMS in v1.
- **Quality:** no AI slop; No Learning Required.
- Philosophy / essence changes require explicit human approval + ADR.
